  },
  "source_name": "https://www.whattoexpect.com/pregnancy/november-birth-flower",
  "source_type": "website",
  "structure": {
    "block_count": 30,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Despite it being a chilly month, your November baby is sure to bring lots of joy to this season and beyond.",
        "text_sha256": "58f7345030a004f9c5ecabf0dffea48007e4060f6922d3db3f7b12cc04062081",
        "word_count": 21
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "November is the season of gratitude, making it an exciting time to welcome a new bundle of joy. And although winter is coming, this month is set to bring you all but gloom. In fact, according to your baby's birth flowers , you're destined for a joyful, generous child who will impress you with her wit.",
        "text_sha256": "cc4839ccee82a38f1256ec962c556d59cb77a8987108af2b3b66d43c3177e673",
        "word_count": 56
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What is the November birth flower?",
        "text_sha256": "569e913a58bfd69e8ee923ef300d898c71a7e2cebf73c36b107e384aa1f61a82",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Chrysanthemum: A symbol of intelligence and fulfillment",
        "text_sha256": "1f6c1523538561b21ce01f6637833cf0b656bdc6b459c4fd326ccc11bfb20cc0",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you have a November baby, her birth flower is the flourishing chrysanthemum. These colorful, abundant flowers are the treasure of any fall garden and your own chrysanthemum is bound to be a treasure as well: a natural-born leader whose giving nature and intellectual prowess will set her up for success.",
        "text_sha256": "23ffb142b5ae36e190f59bd0e870bb0ccc4ef8de2d16bf972ada2a2da0ac5384",
        "word_count": 51
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Chrysanthemums are stunning fall-blooming perennials native to subtropical and temperate areas of Europe, Asia and Africa. Trusted SourceEncyclopedia BritannicachrysanthemumSee All Sources [1] With their spicy aroma, abundant blooms and protective powers against garden pests, chrysanthemums have been a beloved flower across cultures for centuries. Trusted SourceFragranticaChrysanthemumSee All Sources [2]",
        "text_sha256": "3c2cdea2f8ad660e36ecacce98050df71ca01bbb439930dda7fbdc5717a3d079",
        "word_count": 49
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "chrysanthemum",
        "text_sha256": "7ac1b336b681b3ac6109e1fd5be69393a8395cc95218fc5e84a0475ba7b68e4f",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Chrysanthemum",
        "text_sha256": "f62cf0fe54d5cf7dcb26f25b7d519b9f78462489dac62dd0e2a17123b1e3f3ff",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The name chrysanthemum comes from the ancient Greek words for gold (chrysos) and flower (anthos). Trusted SourceNC State University ChrysanthemumSee All Sources [3] The flowers are especially important in traditional Asian art where their fiery, frilly petals symbolize the sun’s rays. In Chinese and Japanese culture, the chrysanthemum is associated with abundance, fulfillment and intellectual accomplishments. Trusted SourceChinese Art: A Guide to Motifs and Visual ImageryChrysanthemumSee All Sources [4]",
        "text_sha256": "7679af843ed3f7e1f0785efb27e42bbb0df3f65159e43fd844a025b758b8dd17",
        "word_count": 69
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Trusted SourceNC State University ChrysanthemumSee All Sources",
        "text_sha256": "6a0b97580c2c1fc2bd54c0ef4aabcda225d41f54f58e34739377c65269b765b3",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Trusted SourceChinese Art: A Guide to Motifs and Visual ImageryChrysanthemumSee All Sources",
        "text_sha256": "7113a1239cd45a849a17020fc7cb32de1ec6fd28b1b3901af89a1865d52dfe8a",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "You can expect your November baby to be as warm as the chrysanthemum’s radiant blooms, not to mention smart as a whip . Your little one knows how to find joy and fulfillment — both in life’s simple moments and pretty much anything she sets her mind to.",
        "text_sha256": "7546d4f4d223d85673579d30b12a9fc8b254bc33d1524c18a630cb15afe7a658",
        "word_count": 48
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Chrysanthemums know that life isn’t a zero-sum game and with their abundant wit, success and joy comes great generosity! You won’t be surprised when your little one develops into a supportive friend and leader with plenty of good ideas and good will to share with everyone in their lives.",
        "text_sha256": "e46499ff5f60cad97bc2eda597675b8609c33ae0f9ec9424bc9feb9960318d87",
        "word_count": 49
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "How to incorporate the chrysanthemum into your family's life",
        "text_sha256": "731ff7ecafebc3a2a20a69b780becc8413cbf41006dc298dbafad41fb511287d",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Chrysanthemums can add some sunshine around your home while also honoring your child's spirit. Not sure just how to incorporate these classic blooms into your space? Here are some ideas:",
        "text_sha256": "4c888b541e3c0866aa673f30e7d897f177a50032bbfde9e1e26bf82e502f72c9",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Make them your garden centerpiece. Chrysanthemums are easy to find as potted plants at grocery stores and nurseries in the early fall. They make for great centerpieces or porch flowers. Once the flowers are past their prime, you can pop them in the ground and they will keep coming back for years.",
        "text_sha256": "f49b4cdf5cb41c79c4b0a1f42d639fbfbde7a9eb6f10ff4a6461da25324dbd1c",
        "word_count": 52
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Invest in a watercolor print. Hang a chrysanthemum watercolor print in your child’s nursery . How to find one? Just search \"Kawarazaki Shodo’s chrysanthemums art prints\" and you'll find gobs of options for sale online.",
        "text_sha256": "139749b588ae1c7263bb11606fb5979a2dc8ba877b1921f58c05c410f4e29e67",
        "word_count": 35
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Don't pass on the paper flowers. Looking for a calming DIY project and some alone time? Check out these instructions for paper chrysanthemums. Arrange in bouquets around the house or hang them as art in your little one’s nursery .",
        "text_sha256": "c2512c69f4257e9a72a58abf2d5bc6a8171462021999aec02c7cad115e16d358",
        "word_count": 40
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Have a baby photo shoot . Dress up your little one as the world’s cutest potted chrysanthemum or nestle her within its lacy petals . These photos will be perfect for wall art in your nursery or bargaining chips during those teenage years.",
        "text_sha256": "835362c9b6e9a4a9aa35bdc7b0c5e7d29a87f64871bb47b51d219c929d2b4d42",
        "word_count": 43
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Try some tea. Chrysanthemum has long been a popular medicinal herb. Try making a hot or iced version of this perfect chrysanthemum tea or see if your preschooler enjoys this recipe for chrysanthemum lemonade.",
        "text_sha256": "83947245f54e9af1787cf9c634dbf59ab05f65755c5f5d5928bf51b95f12792f",
        "word_count": 34
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Looking for more fun insights about your baby? Discover the astrological traits of your baby with our free Birth Chart Calculator .",
        "text_sha256": "c863c6e279b90aa2b869ed7ed1f595b2b9decf9af9e26f88a6efd7692de37f27",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Sources",
        "text_sha256": "caf85b0888d78f1f83771a07b25c3d30fa1210242f2fae6e5ae5d9a686602800",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
